            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Woche"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This account has two-factor authentication turned on. Enter the code from your authenticator app to sign in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此账户已启用双重认证。请输入身份验证器应用中的验证码以登录。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Für dieses Konto ist die Zwei-Faktor-Authentifizierung aktiviert. Gib zum Anmelden den Code aus deiner Authentifizierungs-App ein."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This action cannot be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Aktion kann nicht widerrufen werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes the project and all %lld tasks in it, including any sub-projects. This can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "This permanently deletes the project and the task in it, including any sub-projects. This can't be undone."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "This permanently deletes the project and all %lld tasks in it, including any sub-projects. This can't be undone."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "这将永久删除该项目及其中的全部%lld个任务，包括所有子项目。此操作无法撤销。"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Damit werden das Projekt und %lld darin enthaltene Aufgabe endgültig gelöscht, einschließlich aller Unterprojekte. Das kann nicht widerrufen werden."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Damit werden das Projekt und alle %lld darin enthaltenen Aufgaben endgültig gelöscht, einschließlich aller Unterprojekte. Das kann nicht widerrufen werden."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This permanently deletes the project and all of its tasks, including any sub-projects. This can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这将永久删除该项目及其中的全部任务，包括所有子项目。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Damit werden das Projekt und alle seine Aufgaben endgültig gelöscht, einschließlich aller Unterprojekte. Das kann nicht widerrufen werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This project has no Kanban columns yet" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此项目尚无看板分栏"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieses Projekt hat noch keine Spalten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server's single sign-on address doesn't look right. Check the provider setup on your server." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此服务器的单点登录地址似乎不正确。请检查服务器上的提供商配置。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die Single-Sign-on-Adresse dieses Servers scheint nicht zu stimmen. Prüfe die Anbieter-Einrichtung auf deinem Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server's single sign-on provider is missing a client ID. Check the provider setup on your server." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此服务器的单点登录提供商缺少客户端 ID。请检查服务器上的提供商配置。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beim Single-Sign-on-Anbieter dieses Servers fehlt eine Client-ID. Prüfe die Anbieter-Einrichtung auf deinem Server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This will remove your server configuration. You'll need to reconnect." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这将移除服务器配置，你需要重新连接。"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dadurch wird deine Server-Konfiguration entfernt. Du musst dich danach neu verbinden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time of day applied to tasks you add to Today without picking a time, and to tasks you add through Siri. Pick a time later in the day to avoid the task showing as overdue right away." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用于添加到“今天”但未指定时间的任务，以及通过 Siri 添加的任务。建议选择当天较晚的时间，以免任务立即显示为逾期。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "stale"
    },
    "Time of day applied to tasks you add to Today without picking a time. Pick a time later in the day to avoid the task showing as overdue right away." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale"
    },
    "Title" : {
      "localizations" : {
